## https://github.com/mikeleppane/envx?ref=terminaltrove#-tui-keyboard-shortcuts
envx (Normal) Navigate up/down                   | j/k / Up/Dn
envx (Normal) Navigate by page                   | PgDn/PgUp
envx (Normal) Jump to first/last item            | Home/End
envx (Normal) View variable details              | v/Etr
envx (Normal) Enter search mode                  | /
envx (Normal) Add new variable                   | a
envx (Normal) Edit selected variable             | e
envx (Normal) Delete selected variable           | d
envx (Normal) Refresh list                       | r
envx (Normal) Quit                               | q
envx (Search) Cancel search                      | Esc
envx (Search) Apply search                       | ntr
envx (Edit) Switch between name and value fields | Tab
envx (Edit) Save changes                         | C-Etr
envx (Edit) Cancel editing                       | Esc